means its coefficient is $0.$ Similarly, the variable $y$ does not appear in the second equation, which means that its coefficient is $0$ too. So, we get\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}0x+8y &=-8 \\\\ -4x+0y &=7\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 8 \\\\ -4 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=\\begin{bmatrix}-8 \\\\ 7\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 8 \\\\ -4 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-8 \\\\ 7\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299615 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ee6fa2ad-2b85-57a8-b12e-28d17fd5622d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298563}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186298563} :answer-field/id #uuid "39a88230-3e9b-5a2d-a7ce-0c8f6b0171b3" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298831} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "15d7e173-7c89-510e-87a3-bec205bd32ea" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297645}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186297645} :answer-field/id #uuid "3ea53bf5-1869-5e91-9ffc-1997e3406933" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298854} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8e307738-40fb-5d28-a61a-04eba39be6c3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298169}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186298169} :answer-field/id #uuid "6efc2313-99bf-58dd-8450-07452587dfb2" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299011} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "dac9b2f4-b254-5d28-b4b7-049389a67faa" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298492}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186298492} :answer-field/id #uuid "eebcab81-d756-5c6c-bcd5-affa7d1b82f4" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299443}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "a86d8468-1029-529b-a5d8-f3aa18370d7b" :question/math-academy-id "q-317521" :question/problem "For the following system of equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2x+5 &=y \\\\ 3x-2y &=7,\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nits representation using matrices is\n\n| |  | {{field-1}} | $-1$ |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-2}} | {{field-3}} |  | |  |  |  | |  | $x$ |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n|  | $y$ |  | | $=$ | |  | {{field-4}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n|  | $7$ |  | |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-1}} | $-1$ |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {{field-2}} | {{field-3}} |  |  |  |  |\n|  | $x$ |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  | $y$ |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {{field-4}} |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  | $7$ |  |  |  |  |  |\n\n." :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that it is in the correct order and  both $x$ and $y$ appear in each equation:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2x-y &=-5 \\\\ 3x-2y &=7\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -1 \\\\ 3 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ 7\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -1 \\\\ 3 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ 7\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/re